    "stem": "有關Endocrine therapy 與CDK4/6 inhibitor 治療藥物機轉與疾病相關敘述，下列敘述何者正確？ (1) MONARCH-1 study confirmed the single-agent abemaciclib activity in poor-prognosis, heavily pretreated population with refractory HR+/HER2- metastatic breast cancer． (2) Young-PEARL (Palbociclib+AI) and Right-CHOICE (Ribociclib+AI) studies both reported the statistical difference of PFS and OS results compared to upfront chemotherapy control groups. (3) Raloxifene is a SERM originally developed to treat osteoporosis. Large placebo-controlled randomized trials demonstrated reduced rates of osteoporosis and a reduction in new breast cancers． (4) 2-year Adjuvant Abemaciclib with endocrine therapy after surgery/chemotherapy/radiotherapy is the current standard care of high-risk ER+HER2- EBC because of the significant overall survival benefit from MONARCH-E trial results.",
